    {
      "text": "Figure 2, agent generation metrics, in four panels. Each groups three bars — Cline (green), Custom (orange, the specialist system) and Roo (blue). (a) Total tokens per generation, per workflow, with the axis in thousands and ↓ better: the orange bar is lowest in every one of the ten workflows, the widest gaps at Weather (Custom 9.2 vs Cline 2498.0 and Roo 4662.4) and Tournament (27.7 vs 1849.1 and 4362.1). (b) Repair iterations per workflow, ↓ better: Custom reads 0.00 for all ten; Cline and Roo reach 6.00 (Deal and Weather respectively). (c) Total tokens across all workflows: Cline 1021.8k, Custom 53.8k, Roo 1468.6k. (d) Repair iterations across all workflows: Cline 1.85, Custom 0.00, Roo 2.04. NOTE, as a reading of the chart rather than a claim about the work: §4.3.1 of the text gives the aggregate repair figures as \"2.08 for Roo and 1.89 for Cline\", where panel (d) is labelled 2.04 and 1.85.",
      "state": "draft",
